.nh
.TH "PB-TEAM-MACHINE-REQUESTS" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-team-machine-requests - List machines waiting for a team owner or admin


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb team machine requests <team> [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List machines waiting for an owner or admin to accept them, one line each with machine ID,
name, state and who asked. Prints "No machines are waiting." when there are none.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for requests

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  pb team machine requests acme
  pb team machine requests acme --json
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-team-machine(1)\fP
